              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/product/{{productId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "product", "{{productId}}"]
            },
            "description": "**[PATCH] /product/:id**\n\nUpdate data produk berdasarkan ID. Memerlukan autentikasi.\n\nSemua field bersifat **optional** (partial update - `PartialType` dari `CreateProductDto`):\n- `name` (string)\n- `categoryId` (string, CUID)\n- `description` (string)\n- `price` (number, positive)\n- `stock` (number, >= 0)\n- `sku` (string)\n- `images` (string[])\n\n**Path Param:** `id` - CUID produk yang akan diupdate"
          },
