        {
          "name": "Get All Products",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/product?page=1&limit=10&search=sneakers&sortOrder=desc",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "product"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "(Optional) Halaman ke berapa, default: 1, min: 1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "10",
                  "description": "(Optional) Jumlah data per halaman, default: 10, min: 1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "sneakers",
                  "description": "(Optional) Kata kunci pencarian produk"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sortOrder",
                  "value": "desc",
                  "description": "(Optional) Urutan sort: asc atau desc, default: desc"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**[GET] /product** *(Allow Anonymous)*\n\nMendapatkan semua produk dengan dukungan pagination, pencarian, dan sorting.\n\n**Query Params (semua optional):**\n- `page` (integer, >= 1) - Nomor halaman, default: `1`\n- `limit` (integer, >= 1) - Jumlah item per halaman, default: `10`\n- `search` (string) - Filter berdasarkan kata kunci\n- `sortOrder` (`asc` / `desc`) - Urutan sort, default: `desc`"
          },
